{"cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.375, "text": "Some recent work by E. Fermi and L. Szilard,", "ph": "s\u02cc\u028cm \u0279\u02c8i\u02d0s\u0259nt w\u02c8\u025c\u02d0k ba\u026a \u02c8i\u02d0. f\u02c8\u025c\u02d0mi and \u02c8\u025bl. s\u02c8\u026al\u0251\u02d0d,"}, {"start": 3.695, "end": 7.05, "text": "which has been communicated to me in manuscript,", "ph": "w\u02cc\u026at\u0283 h\u02c8azbi\u02d0n k\u0259mj\u02c8u\u02d0n\u026ak\u02cce\u026at\u026ad t\u0259 m\u02cci\u02d0 \u026an m\u02c8anju\u02d0sk\u0279\u02cc\u026apt,"}, {"start": 7.37, "end": 14.14, "text": "leads me to expect that the element uranium may be turned into a new and important source of energy", "ph": "l\u02c8i\u02d0dz m\u02cci\u02d0 t\u028a \u025bksp\u02c8\u025bkt \u00f0at\u00f0\u026a \u02c8\u025bl\u026am\u0259nt j\u028a\u0259\u0279\u02c8e\u026ani\u0259m m\u02c8e\u026a bi\u02d0 t\u02c8\u025c\u02d0nd \u02cc\u026ant\u028a \u0250 nj\u02c8u\u02d0 and \u026amp\u02c8\u0254\u02d0t\u0259nt s\u02c8\u0254\u02d0s \u0252v \u02c8\u025bn\u0259d\u0292i"}, {"start": 14.46, "end": 16.048, "text": "in the immediate future.", "ph": "\u026an\u00f0\u026a \u026am\u02c8i\u02d0d\u026a\u0259t fj\u02c8u\u02d0t\u0283\u0259."}], "synth_s": 10.77, "audio_s": 16.048, "env50": [0.05, 0.174, 0.222, 0.183, 0.178, 0.908, 0.702, 0.523, 0.496, 0.485, 0.474, 0.501, 0.544, 0.549, 0.524, 0.589, 0.553, 0.459, 0.407, 0.464, 0.406, 0.308, 0.233, 0.201, 0.154, 0.185, 0.568, 0.467, 0.378, 0.259, 0.145, 0.162, 0.336, 0.524, 0.608, 0.673, 0.574, 0.517, 0.505, 0.417, 0.368, 0.301, 0.182, 0.069, 0.023, 0.026, 0.034, 0.021, 0.02, 0.006, 0.001, 0.05, 0.504, 0.532, 0.473, 0.514, 0.503, 0.388, 0.179, 0.051, 0.008, 0.007, 0.078, 0.345, 0.481, 0.533, 0.506, 0.446, 0.432, 0.437, 0.434, 0.346, 0.141, 0.066, 0.046, 0.037, 0.03, 0.032, 0.047, 0.378, 0.76, 0.664, 0.573, 0.524, 0.453, 0.457, 0.519, 0.497, 0.496, 0.514, 0.47, 0.458, 0.513, 0.494, 0.448, 0.477, 0.432, 0.447, 0.452, 0.486, 0.356, 0.212, 0.105, 0.129, 0.283, 0.43, 0.523, 0.561, 0.489, 0.475, 0.38